# P1 (QUALIFICATION): packed prefix reuse, exactness AND lifecycle in one job, on c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-full-audit (audit twin of the shipping profile: prefix reuse with sticky sessions,
# GDN checkpoints at 2048). Two arms of c2_prefix_gate: exactness-shared (concurrent same-tenant agents sharing the system block continue in packed rounds,
# hits from ~5k up, every hit byte-identical to its solo cold twin, per-window KV digests equal, AT LEAST ONE PACKED ROUND WITH 2+ LIVE USERS) and
# lifecycle-evict (four arrivals at once, abort while waiting, ABORT DURING A HIT PREFILL, a KV flood that EVICTS conversations, reset_prefix_cache, the KILL
# SWITCH file: grants off, latched, nothing published under it; an in-place restart). READ: the gate verdicts: no FAIL; a returning turn is byte-equal to
# cold (strict: the fast path is batch invariant, NOT_COMPARABLE is no excuse); no program compiled by a hit after its cold twin; the kill switch row;
# 'aborted as intended' lines for the two drills only. Baseline none (nothing here is a timing comparison). exactness-eager, -traced, -audit, lifecycle-store,
# lifecycle-tiny and timing are dropped from this lean pack. Real time: ESTIMATE ~110 (no measured time for these arms on the W1 window; their docker
# timeouts are 7200 and 9000 s): the dominant job of the pack.
# TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the ship/262k-full pack (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over that file on a throwaway
# commit of ship/262k-full (with its evidence files committed) and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Names no rig, card, host or registry. ORDER.txt has
# the order, stop rules, real minutes, NEEDS and the GO rule. C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-10 is the ONE shipping image X0B builds: every job serves it.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset prefix
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-10
C2_PREFIX_PLAN=exactness-shared,lifecycle-evict
C2_PREFIX_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-full-audit
C2_PREFIX_BASELINE=none
